{"id":"f6855233de747077","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-magari-algebra.md","title":"Magari 可证性代数","display":"df-magari-algebra — Magari 可证性代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-magari-algebra","aliases":["72-df-magari-algebra"],"display":"df-magari-algebra — Magari 可证性代数","depends_on":[],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §5, print485–486/PDF497–498; explicit Boolean-algebra presentation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"explicit algebraic definition checked; source names and correspondence checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将布尔序缩写纳入形式断言"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-magari-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-magari-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-magari-algebra — Magari 可证性代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §5, print485–486/PDF497–498; explicit Boolean-algebra presentation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"explicit algebraic definition checked; source names and correspondence checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将布尔序缩写纳入形式断言"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in B\">\\(0,1\\in B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\Box:B\\to B\">\\(\\neg,\\Box:B\\to B\\)</span> 为结构输入。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg\\rangle\">\\(\\langle B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg\\rangle\\)</span> 为布尔代数，允许单点代数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in B\">\\(a,b\\in B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 是下式定义的布尔序。下式给出额外算子资格。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\wedge b=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\wedge b=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mag}(B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,\\Box)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Box1=1\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in B\\ (\\Box(a\\wedge b)=\\Box a\\wedge\\Box b)\\land\n\\forall a\\in B\\ \\bigl(\\Box(\\neg\\Box a\\vee a)\\le\\Box a\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mag}(B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,\\Box)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Box1=1\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in B\\ (\\Box(a\\wedge b)=\\Box a\\wedge\\Box b)\\land\n\\forall a\\in B\\ \\bigl(\\Box(\\neg\\Box a\\vee a)\\le\\Box a\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在 §5 将布尔代数加可证性算子的等式刻画称为 Magari 或 diagonalizable algebra；这里明确选择 GL 的正常算子与 Löb 不等式作为定义。布尔代数结构是声明的标准基础结构，未把额外算子的性质藏在名称中。由保有限交可导单调性；Löb 不等式对应模态公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"0,1\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\Box:B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"a\\le b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\wedge b=a.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mag}(B,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,\\Box)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Box1=1\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in B\\ (\\Box(a\\wedge b)=\\Box a\\wedge\\Box b)\\land\n\\forall a\\in B\\ \\bigl(\\Box(\\neg\\Box a\\vee a)\\le\\Box a\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1744,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-526","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-p